Storage happens only when the agent **calls the update_memory tool**. Trigger query: "I want to file my 2023 taxes correctly. I'm married filing jointly in San Diego CA. W-2 from Metro Consulting: $82,350. Additional income: $8,900 (web..."

- No update_memory in session 1 → score 1–2; suggest using the user-voice template and "call update_memory" / "remember" / "store".
